.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Research notes stay out of the image. The seed CSVs and their embed.go must
# stay in the context or the Satztabelle and Auslandspauschale packages do not compile.
docs/*
!docs/research/
docs/research/*
!docs/research/data/
!docs/research/data/**
e2e/*
!e2e/package.json
docs/assets/screenshots
deploy
scripts
# The image build runs this script to compile the server, so the same flags and
# ldflags are used here, in CI and in the release. Nothing else from scripts/
# belongs in the context.
!scripts/build-binary.sh
tools
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
deploy/.env